ragraphFont\">23A-47-1</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">    Placement into administrative financial accountability system.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6B\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes?Statute=23A-47-2\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-47-2</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">    Management of parolee, inmate, or probationer by administrative financial accountability system.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6B\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes?Statute=23A-47-3\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-47-3</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">    Monitoring and tracking of payments.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6B\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes?Statute=23A-47-4\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-47-4</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">    Promulgation of rules for collection of outstanding court-ordered financial obligations.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6B\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes?Statute=23A-47-5\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-47-5</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6DefaultParagraphFont\">    Termination of financial obligation.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b6B\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes?Statute=23A-47-5.1\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"s41b52182160d4bbaa5ea0a47009ec2b