e financial accountability system.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049263Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049263000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049263Normal\"><span class=\"s2049263SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049263SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/2013/101/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 2013, ch 101\">SL 2013, ch 101</a>, § 43, eff. Jan. 1, 2014.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2049264Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049264SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049264CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2049264Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049264DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049264000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049264SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049264SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049264Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-47-2\"><span class=\"s2049264SENU\">23A-47-2</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049264SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2049264CL\">Management of parolee, inmate, or probationer by administrative financial accountability system.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049264Normal-000000\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049264DefaultParagraphFont\">A parolee, inmate, or probationer, who is discharged from supervision but has outstanding, court-ordered financial obligations, shall be managed by the administrative financial accountability system, as administered pursuant to § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-47-3\"><span class=\"s2049264DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-47-3</span></a><span class=\"s2049264DefaultParagraphFont\">, in order to satisfy all court-ordered financial obligations.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049264Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049264000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049264Normal\"><span class=\"s2049264SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049264SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/2013/101/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 2013, ch 101\">SL 2013, ch 101</a>, § 44, eff. Jan. 1, 2014; <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/2015/142/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 2015, ch 142\">SL 2015, ch 142</a>, § 1.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2049265Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049265SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049265CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2049265Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049265DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049265000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049265SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049265SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049265Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-47-3\"><span class=\"s2049265SENU\">23A-47-3</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049265SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2049265CL\">Monitoring and tracking of payments.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049265Normal-000000\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049265DefaultParagraphFont\">The administrative financial accountability system shall be administered by the Unified Judicial System pursuant to § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-28-3\"><span class=\"s2049265DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-28-3</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049265DefaultParagraphFont\"> and shall monitor and track payments within the system.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049265Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049265000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049265Normal\"><span class=\"s2049265SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049265SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/2013/101/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 2013, ch 101\">SL 2013, ch 101</a>, § 45, eff. Jan. 1, 2014; <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/2015/142/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 2015, ch 142\">SL 2015, ch 142</a>, § 2.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2049266Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;